/*
 * Odyssey micro resources — the item category.
 *
 * Items — the physical goods collected and traded on foot.
 *
 * Sources: EDCD FDevIDs, microresources.csv; in-game verification.
 *
 * Credit and licence terms: ATTRIBUTIONS.md. Acquisition, revisions, derivation and
 * corrections: data/materials/SOURCES.md.
 *
 * Each record is { symbol, name }. `symbol` is Frontier's internal id
 * (e.g. `graphene`) — what the player journal reports, matched case-insensitively;
 * `name` is the display name. The file determines the `item` category, so it is not
 * repeated on every record. Frontier's numeric micro-resource id is not carried.
 */
